+ '/browse', 'Open Home', 2),
+
+('is-free', 'About',
+ 'Is it free? Do I have to pay anything?',
+ 'Yes, it is completely free. There are no payments on the platform, neither for donors nor for people receiving food.',
+ array['free','cost','price','pay','payment','charge','fee','fees','charges','money','paid','subscription'],
+ null, null, 3),
+
+('who-can-use', 'About',
+ 'Who can use the app?',
+ 'Anyone with an account. There are no separate account types: every user can donate food, request food, and volunteer to deliver. The only special role is admin, which is given only by existing admins and is used for moderation.',
+ array['who can use','who can join','account type','role','roles','user type','eligible','individual','restaurant','ngo','recipient','donor','volunteer','all users'],
+ null, null, 4),
+
+('how-signup', 'Account',
+ 'How do I create an account?',
+ 'Click Sign up and enter your name, email and a password. You do not need to choose an account type. Depending on how the app is configured, you may get an email to confirm your address before you can log in. After that you land on the Home page, where you can browse food, donate or deliver.',
+ array['sign up','signup','register account','register as user','create account','new account','registration','get started','how to start','email confirmation','confirm email'],
+ '/signup', 'Sign up', 5),
+
+('how-login', 'Account',
+ 'How do I log in or log out?',
+ 'Use the Log in page with your email and password. To log out, use the sign-out icon in the top bar on desktop, or open the menu on your phone and choose Sign out.',
+ array['login','log in','sign in','logout','log out','sign out','cannot login','cant login','access account'],
